      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#7D5CFF>\xBB</color>  <b>Runtime API:</b> binding.Binding.SourceRoot
    / MemberName, RefreshBinding(), UpdateMode; NoCodeFormattedText.SetValues(sources,
    format); SetProgress.SetRange(min, max).\n<color=#7D5CFF>\xBB</color>  <b>Scene
    workflow:</b> Select any label or bar on the right: its NoCode component names
    the source object, component and member. Buttons call Counter.Add / Set through
    persistent UnityEvents.\n<color=#7D5CFF>\xBB</color>  <b>Verification:</b> Play:
    +10 / -10 or drag the slider - the Reactive bindings follow at once, Poll catches
    up within 0.5 s, Once changes only on RefreshBinding().\n<color=#7D5CFF>\xBB</color> 
    Buttons / slider -> Counter.Add / Counter.Set (NoCode)\n<color=#7D5CFF>\xBB</color> 
    Counter.Value -> NoCodeBindText, NoCodeFormattedText, SetProgress\n<color=#7D5CFF>\xBB</color> 
    Poll binding -> OnTextChanged -> log"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
